# Axis-aligned unit cube, centred on the origin: [-0.5, 0.5] on every axis.
# Faces are written as quads to exercise the loader's triangulation, and the
# file carries no normals or texture coordinates so that flat shading is used.
# Vertex order per face is counter-clockwise seen from outside.

v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5

f 1 2 3 4
f 6 5 8 7
f 5 1 4 8
f 2 6 7 3
f 4 3 7 8
f 5 6 2 1
